================================================================================
                          RELEASE PRINCIPLE
================================================================================

  Commons of knowledge. Stewardship of power.

  Open to verify. Open to learn. Open to challenge.
  Permissioned to commercialise, package, weaponise, brand, or scale.

  The legal licences below are the LEGAL FLOOR of this release, not its
  philosophical statement. They use "non-commercial" as a blunt proxy
  because licences cannot enforce nuance. The full release principle and
  the stewardship frame are in NOTICE, and must be read alongside this
  LICENSE.

  The core mathematical claims and the reproducibility path are released
  for independent review, reproduction, criticism, teaching, and
  non-commercial research use. The applied implementation layer is
  stewarded: commercial use, packaged simulators, derivative product
  systems, hosted services, proprietary integrations, mass-scale
  distribution, branded packaging, and other high-impact use require
  written permission from the author. See NOTICE §2 for the full
  permission-pathway list.

