================================================================================
DEFINITIONS
================================================================================

"Commercial use" means any use that is primarily intended for or
directed toward commercial advantage or monetary compensation, including
but not limited to: incorporating this work into a paid product,
offering it as part of a paid service, using it to generate revenue
directly or indirectly, or distributing it to clients of a commercial
enterprise.

"Verification use" means running the suites in scripts/ (via
run_all_verifications.sh) to reproduce the numerical claims, study the
derivations, or evaluate the framework's reproducibility. This is the
primary intended use and is permitted under PolyForm Noncommercial 1.0.0
without additional permission.

"Research and educational use" means use by academics, students,
independent researchers, or science communicators for the purpose of
learning, teaching, criticism, or non-commercial publication. This is
permitted under both CC BY-NC 4.0 (papers and docs) and PolyForm
Noncommercial 1.0.0 (scripts) without additional permission.

